-> contract
-> native
> The deterministic local fixture repeats one HTML-shaped fragment 2,400 times and measures 705,600 source bytes, 189,600 tokenizer tokens, and 747 spans; its fingerprint is b774895d9290c24734e206434915017d1ad8ad8f4c9b89c53fc52b33fd527aa3.
> The current one-call path returns 747 vectors in one Scry embedding API call, which fastembed internally splits into three inferred batches of 256; native sampling at 10 ms observed 4,062,822,400 working-set bytes and 5,180,784,640 Windows private bytes.
> The scale command is benchmark-only and process-local; the issue URL is not fetched, native peaks remain diagnostic, and the fixed v1 artifact is unchanged.
